 "descriptionHtml": "<p>Three rings that refuse to be separated. A polished band studded with round bezel set stones, a slim pavé band and a ring of box chain, joined by small jump rings so they move together. Wear all three on one finger or spread them across two.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear all three on one finger, or spread them across two.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Construction: Three rings joined by small jump rings</li>\n<li>Rings: A polished band with flush set round stones, approximately 5mm; a slim pavé band, approximately 2.5mm; a box chain ring</li>\n<li>Sizes: US 6, 7 and 8</li>\n<li>Plating: 18k gold tone plated or rhodium plated silver tone (choose above)</li>\n<li>Material: Surgical stainless steel</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Waterproof and tarnish free, so daily wear and water are fine. Keep it away from perfume and harsh chemicals, wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
